# Compound unnamed-token names gain "Token" and follow changes to the creating text (CR 111.4, 612.2a).
# Artificial Evolution changes Gnome to Tentacle while Thousand Moons Smithy is a spell. The permanent keeps that text
# change (CR 400.7a), so its enters trigger must create a Tentacle Soldier Token, not a Gnome Soldier. Its subtypes and
# other characteristics are asserted separately; no new card or card-level naming workaround is involved.

